    {
      "source": "Returns <a href=\"#ORDER\">5000</a>, which ensures that the <code>SqlScriptsTestExecutionListener</code>\nis ordered after the\n<a href=\"../transaction/TransactionalTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.transaction\"><code>TransactionalTestExecutionListener</code></a> and before the\n<a href=\"../event/EventPublishingTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.event\"><code>EventPublishingTestExecutionListener</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回 <a href=\"#ORDER\">5000</a>，这确保了 <code>SqlScriptsTestExecutionListener</code> 在 <a href=\"../transaction/TransactionalTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.transaction\"><code>TransactionalTestExecutionListener</code></a> 之后且在 <a href=\"../event/EventPublishingTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.event\"><code>EventPublishingTestExecutionListener</code></a> 之前执行。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute SQL scripts configured via <a href=\"Sql.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.jdbc\"><code>@Sql</code></a> for the supplied\n<a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContext</code></a> once per test class <em>after</em> all test methods\nhave been run.",
      "translation": "为每个测试类在运行完所有测试方法后，执行一次通过<a href=\"Sql.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.jdbc\"><code>@Sql</code></a>配置的 SQL 脚本，针对提供的<a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute SQL scripts configured via <a href=\"Sql.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.jdbc\"><code>@Sql</code></a> for the supplied\n<a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContext</code></a> <em>after</em> the current test method.",
      "translation": "为当前测试方法之后提供的 <a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContext</code></a> 执行通过 <a href=\"Sql.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.jdbc\"><code>@Sql</code></a> 配置的 SQL 脚本。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute SQL scripts configured via <a href=\"Sql.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.jdbc\"><code>@Sql</code></a> for the supplied\n<a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContext</code></a> once per test class <em>before</em> any test method\nis run.",
      "translation": "为每个测试类在运行任何测试方法之前，执行一次通过<a href=\"Sql.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.jdbc\"><code>@Sql</code></a>配置的 SQL 脚本，针对提供的<a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
