    {
      "source": "Execute SQL scripts configured via <a href=\"Sql.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.jdbc\"><code>@Sql</code></a> for the supplied\n<a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContext</code></a> <em>before</em> the current test method.",
      "translation": "为当前测试方法之前，针对提供的 <a href=\"../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContext</code></a> 执行通过 <a href=\"Sql.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.jdbc\"><code>@Sql</code></a> 配置的 SQL 脚本。",
