    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"#getOrder()\"><code>order</code></a> value for this listener: 5000.",
      "translation": "此监听器的<a href=\"#getOrder()\"><code>order</code></a>值为：5000。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Process the supplied test class and its methods and register run-time\nhints for any SQL scripts configured or detected as classpath resources\nvia <a href=\"Sql.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.jdbc\"><code>@Sql</code></a>.",
      "translation": "处理提供的测试类及其方法，并通过<a href=\"Sql.html\" title=\"org.springframework.test.context.jdbc 中的注解接口\"><code>@Sql</code></a>注册任何配置或检测到的作为类路径资源的 SQL 脚本的运行时提示。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../../../transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> <em>and</em> a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a>,\njust a <a href=\"../../../transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>, or just a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a>\nmust be defined as beans in the Spring <a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> for the\ncorresponding test. Consult the javadocs for <a href=\"SqlConfig.html#transactionMode()\"><code>SqlConfig.transactionMode()</code></a>,\n<a href=\"SqlConfig.html#transactionManager()\"><code>SqlConfig.transactionManager()</code></a>, <a href=\"SqlConfig.html#dataSource()\"><code>SqlConfig.dataSource()</code></a>,\n<a href=\"../transaction/TestContextTransactionUtils.html#retrieveDataSource(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext,java.lang.String)\"><code>TestContextTransactionUtils.retrieveDataSource(TestContext, String)</code></a>, and\n<a href=\"../transaction/TestContextTransactionUtils.html#retrieveTransactionManager(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext,java.lang.String)\"><code>TestContextTransactionUtils.retrieveTransactionManager(TestContext, String)</code></a> for details\non permissible configuration constellations and on the algorithms used to\nlocate these beans.",
      "translation": "一个 `<a href=\"../../../transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>` <em>和</em> 一个 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a>`，\n或者仅有一个 `<a href=\"../../../transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>`，\n或者仅有一个 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a>`\n必须在 Spring 的 `<a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>` 中定义为 bean，以用于相应的测试。有关允许的配置文件组合以及用于定位这些 bean 的算法的详细信息，请参阅 `<a href=\"SqlConfig.html#transactionMode()\"><code>SqlConfig.transactionMode()</code></a>`、\n`<a href=\"SqlConfig.html#transactionManager()\"><code>SqlConfig.transactionManager()</code></a>`、`<a href=\"SqlConfig.html#dataSource()\"><code>SqlConfig.dataSource()</code></a>`、\n`<a href=\"../transaction/TestContextTransactionUtils.html#retrieveDataSource(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext,java.lang.String)\"><code>TestContextTransactionUtils.retrieveDataSource(TestContext, String)</code></a>` 以及\n`<a href=\"../transaction/TestContextTransactionUtils.html#retrieveTransactionManager(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext,java.lang.String)\"><code>TestContextTransactionUtils.retrieveTransactionManager(TestContext, String)</code></a>` 的 javadocs。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Class-level annotations that are constrained to a class-level execution\nphase (<a href=\"Sql.ExecutionPhase.html#BEFORE_TEST_CLASS\"><code>BEFORE_TEST_CLASS</code></a> or\n<a href=\"Sql.ExecutionPhase.html#AFTER_TEST_CLASS\"><code>AFTER_TEST_CLASS</code></a>) will be run\n<a href=\"#beforeTestClass(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext)\">once before all test methods</a> or\n<a href=\"#afterTestMethod(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext)\">once after all test methods</a>,\nrespectively. All other scripts and inlined statements will be executed\n<a href=\"#beforeTestMethod(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext)\">before</a> or\n<a href=\"#afterTestMethod(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext)\">after</a> execution of the\ncorresponding <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\">test method</a>, depending\non the configured value of the <a href=\"Sql.html#executionPhase()\"><code>executionPhase</code></a>\nflag.",
      "translation": "限定于类级执行阶段（<a href=\"Sql.ExecutionPhase.html#BEFORE_TEST_CLASS\"><code>BEFORE_TEST_CLASS</code></a> 或 <a href=\"Sql.ExecutionPhase.html#AFTER_TEST_CLASS\"><code>AFTER_TEST_CLASS</code></a>）的类级注解将分别<a href=\"#beforeTestClass(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext)\">在所有测试方法之前运行一次</a>或<a href=\"#afterTestMethod(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext)\">在所有测试方法之后运行一次</a>。所有其他脚本和嵌入语句将根据 <a href=\"Sql.html#executionPhase()\"><code>executionPhase</code></a> 标志的配置值，在相应的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\">测试方法</a>执行<a href=\"#beforeTestMethod(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext)\">之前</a>或<a href=\"#afterTestMethod(org.springframework.test.context.TestContext)\">之后</a>执行。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Scripts and inlined statements will be executed without a transaction,\nwithin an existing Spring-managed transaction, or within an isolated transaction,\ndepending on the configured value of <a href=\"SqlConfig.html#transactionMode()\"><code>SqlConfig.transactionMode()</code></a> and the\npresence of a transaction manager.",
      "translation": "脚本和嵌入的语句将根据配置的<a href=\"SqlConfig.html#transactionMode()\"><code>SqlConfig.transactionMode()</code></a>值以及事务管理器是否存在，在没有事务、在现有的 Spring 管理的事务中或在隔离的事务中执行。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "For details on default script detection and how script resource locations\nare interpreted, see <a href=\"Sql.html#scripts()\"><code>Sql.scripts()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "有关默认脚本检测以及如何解释脚本资源位置的详细信息，请参阅<a href=\"Sql.html#scripts()\"><code>Sql.scripts()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
